Dialogue: 0,00:01:57.16,00:02:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Our pasta this evening is squid ravioli \Nin a lemon grass broth
Dialogue: 0,00:02:01.20,00:02:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,with goat cheese profiteroles, \Nand I also have an arugula Caesar salad.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:05.04,00:02:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,For entrees this evening, \NI have swordfish meatloaf
Dialogue: 0,00:02:07.42,00:02:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,with onion marmalade,
Dialogue: 0,00:02:08.75,00:02:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,rare-roasted partridge breast in \Nraspberry coulis with a sorrel timbale.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:11.96,00:02:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And grilled free-range rabbit \Nwith herbed french fries.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:15.38,00:02:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Our pasta tonight is a squid ravioli \Nin a lemon grass broth,
Dialogue: 0,00:02:18.64,00:02:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and the fish tonight is grilled...
Dialogue: 0,00:02:21.68,00:02:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,With a double espresso.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:24.18,00:02:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,God, I hate this place.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:25.69,00:02:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a chicks' restaurant. \NWhy aren't we at Dorsia?
Dialogue: 0,00:02:27.86,00:02:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Bateman won't give \Nthe maTtre d' head.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:33.74,00:02:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Reed Robinson over there?
Dialogue: 0,00:02:35.03,00:02:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you freebasing or what? \NThat's not Robinson.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:36.99,00:02:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, who is it, then? \N-lt's Paul Allen.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:39.53,00:02:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not Paul Allen.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:41.08,00:02:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Paul Allen's on the other side of \Nthe room over there.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:43.20,00:02:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who's he with? \N- Some weasel from Kicker Peabody.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:45.75,00:02:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't have a good bathroom \Nto do coke in.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:47.67,00:02:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure that's Paul Allen over there?
Dialogue: 0,00:02:49.29,00:02:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, McDoofus, I am.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:50.63,00:02:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's handling the Fisher account.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:52.00,00:02:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky bastard.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:53.21,00:02:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky Jew bastard.
Dialogue: 0,00:02:54.72,00:02:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus, McDermott, \Nwhat does that have to do with anything?
Dialogue: 0,00:02:57.30,00:02:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen that bastard \Nsitting in his office
Dialogue: 0,00:02:59.30,00:03:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,talking on the phone to the CEO, \Nspinning a fuckin' menorah.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:01.89,00:03:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a menorah. You spin a dreidel.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:04.43,00:03:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, Bateman,
Dialogue: 0,00:03:05.98,00:03:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you want me to fry you up \Nsome fuckin' potato pancakes?
Dialogue: 0,00:03:08.56,00:03:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Some latkes? \N- No, just
Dialogue: 0,00:03:11.32,00:03:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,cool it with the anti-Semitic remarks.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:13.28,00:03:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd forgotten. \NBateman's dating someone from the ACLU.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:17.49,00:03:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the voice of reason. \NThe boy next door.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:20.53,00:03:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of reasonable...
Dialogue: 0,00:03:22.49,00:03:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Only $570.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:25.25,00:03:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,00:03:27.04,00:03:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- A little something for the purse. \N- Give her the $50.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:10.25,00:04:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Two Ste“ on the rocks.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:04:11.79,00:04:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,These aren't good anymore.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:13.17,00:04:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a cash bar.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:16.46,00:04:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be $25.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:21.39,00:04:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fucking ugly bitch.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:23.68,00:04:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stab you to death,
Dialogue: 0,00:04:25.56,00:04:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,then play around with your blood.
Dialogue: 0,00:04:39.19,00:04:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I get for you two?
Dialogue: 0,00:05:06.22,00:05:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I live in the American Gardens building \Non West 81st Street, on the 11th floor.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:12.02,00:05:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>My name is Patrick Bateman.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:14.06,00:05:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I'm 27 years old.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:17.44,00:05:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I believe in taking care of myself,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:19.44,00:05:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>in a balanced diet,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:21.40,00:05:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>in a rigorous exercise routine.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:24.45,00:05:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>In the morning, \Nif my face is a little puffy,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:26.87,00:05:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I'll put on an ice pack \Nwhile doing my stomach crunches.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:30.37,00:05:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I can do 1,000 now.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:49.26,00:05:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>After I remove the ice pack,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:51.02,00:05:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I use a deep pore cleanser lotion.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:53.69,00:05:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>In the shower, \NI use a water-activated gel cleanser...</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:05:59.27,00:06:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>then a honey-almond body scrub,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:02.07,00:06:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and on the face, an exfoliating gel scrub.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:15.04,00:06:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Then I apply an herb mint facial mask,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:17.38,00:06:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>which I leave on for ten minutes \Nwhile I prepare the rest of my routine.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:23.92,00:06:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I always use an aftershave lotion</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:26.05,00:06:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>with little or no alcohol,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:28.22,00:06:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>because alcohol dries your face out</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:30.39,00:06:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and makes you look older.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:32.10,00:06:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Then moisturizer,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:34.06,00:06:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>then an anti-aging eye balm,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:36.06,00:06:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>followed by a final moisturizing \Nprotective lotion.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:40.65,00:06:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>There is an idea of a Patrick Bateman.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:44.19,00:06:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Some kind of abstraction.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:46.20,00:06:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>But there is no real me,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:48.53,00:06:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>only an entity, something illusory,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:51.74,00:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and though I can hide my cold gaze</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:54.12,00:06:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and you can shake my hand \Nand feel flesh gripping yours,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:57.33,00:06:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and maybe you can even sense</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:06:58.92,00:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>our lifestyles are probably comparable,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:07:02.38,00:07:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I simply am not there.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:07:32.58,00:07:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Hamilton. Nice tan.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:39.96,00:07:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Aerobics class, sorry. Any messages?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:42.21,00:07:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricky Harrison has to cancel.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:44.21,00:07:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't say what \Nhe was canceling or why.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:46.17,00:07:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I occasionally box with Ricky \Nat the Harvard Club. Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:49.89,00:07:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Spencer wants to meet for drinks \Nat Flutie's Pier 17.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:52.35,00:07:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- When? \N- After 6:00.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:53.93,00:07:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative. Cancel it.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:55.43,00:07:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And what should I say?
Dialogue: 0,00:07:56.56,00:07:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say no.
Dialogue: 0,00:07:57.98,00:07:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say no?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:00.15,00:08:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Jean,
Dialogue: 0,00:08:02.02,00:08:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I need reservations \Nfor three at Camols at 12:30,
Dialogue: 0,00:08:05.23,00:08:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and if not there, try Crayons, all right?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:07.24,00:08:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:09.24,00:08:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, and I need reservations for two
Dialogue: 0,00:08:11.87,00:08:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,at Arcadia at 8:00 on Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:15.45,00:08:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Something romantic?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:17.54,00:08:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,00:08:20.29,00:08:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Silly.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:21.96,00:08:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, I'll make them.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:23.29,00:08:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I'll do it. \N- No, no.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:25.09,00:08:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a doll and just get me a mineral water, \Nokay?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:28.38,00:08:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You look nice today.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:30.38,00:08:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't wear that outfit again.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:32.26,00:08:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I didn't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:33.60,00:08:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, "Do not wear that outfit again."
Dialogue: 0,00:08:35.97,00:08:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wear a dress, a skirt or something.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:38.81,00:08:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like this, I take it?
Dialogue: 0,00:08:40.35,00:08:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you're prettier than that.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:43.69,00:08:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:45.61,00:08:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not here.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:47.23,00:08:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And high heels.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:48.82,00:08:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I like high heels.
Dialogue: 0,00:08:59.12,00:09:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Feathered Friends for 600.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:09:00.62,00:09:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>During courtship, the male frigatebird</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:09:02.92,00:09:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>inflates to enormous size \Nthe red pouch found here.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:09:21.14,00:09:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thousands of roses,
Dialogue: 0,00:09:22.94,00:09:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and lots of chocolate truffles,
Dialogue: 0,00:09:24.81,00:09:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Godiva, and oysters on the half shell...
Dialogue: 0,00:09:27.61,00:09:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I'm trying to listen to \Nthe new Robert Palmer tape,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:09:30.44,00:09:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>but Evelyn, my supposed fiancée,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:09:32.65,00:09:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>keeps buzzing in my ear.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:09:35.45,00:09:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Annie Leibovitz. \NWe'll get Annie Leibovitz.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:38.41,00:09:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll have to get \Nsomeone to videotape.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:41.66,00:09:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick, we should do it.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:44.87,00:09:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do what?
Dialogue: 0,00:09:46.50,00:09:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get married. Have a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:47.96,00:09:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't take the time off work.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:49.84,00:09:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father practically owns the company. \NYou can do anything you like.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:52.51,00:09:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:53.84,00:09:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You hate that job anyway.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:55.84,00:09:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see why you just don't quit.
Dialogue: 0,00:09:57.64,00:10:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I want to fit in.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:12.86,00:10:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Williams party.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:15.20,00:10:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I'm on the verge of tears \Nby the time we arrive at Espace,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:10:18.16,00:10:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>since I'm positive \Nwe won't have a decent table,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:10:21.41,00:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>but we do,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:10:22.58,00:10:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and relief washes over me \Nin an awesome wave.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:10:25.92,00:10:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick, this is my cousin Vanden \Nand her boyfriend, Stash.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:30.09,00:10:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both artists.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:31.63,00:10:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- The menu is in Braille. \N- I see you've met everyone.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:33.72,00:10:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You look awesome.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:36.76,00:10:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, all right.
Dialogue: 0,00:10:40.47,00:10:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I'm fairly certain that Timothy Bryce \Nand Evelyn are having an affair.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:10:45.06,00:10:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Timothy is the only \Ninteresting person I know.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:10:47.98,00:10:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I'm almost completely indifferent</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:10:49.61,00:10:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>as to whether Evelyn knows \NI'm having an affair</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:10:52.73,00:10:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>with Courtney Rawlinson, \Nher closest friend.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:10:56.91,00:10:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Courtney is almost perfect-looking.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:10:59.66,00:11:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>She's usually operating on \None or more psychiatric drugs.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:11:02.29,00:11:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Tonight, I believe it's Xanax.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:11:04.54,00:11:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>More disturbing than her drug use, though,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:11:06.66,00:11:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>is the fact that she's engaged \Nto Luis Carruthers,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:11:09.88,00:11:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>the biggest doofus in the business.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:11:11.67,00:11:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Stash,
Dialogue: 0,00:11:13.96,00:11:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,do you think Soho \Nis becoming too commercial?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:17.55,00:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I read that.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:19.22,00:11:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who gives a rat's ass?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:21.01,00:11:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that affects us.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:22.43,00:11:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:23.52,00:11:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what about the massacres \Nin Sri Lanka, honey?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:26.06,00:11:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that affect us, too?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:27.27,00:11:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, do you know \Nanything about Sri Lanka?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:29.02,00:11:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How, like, the Sikhs are killing \Nlike tons of Israelis over there?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:31.73,00:11:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Bryce.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:33.19,00:11:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot more important problems \Nthan Sri Lanka to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:36.78,00:11:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,00:11:37.86,00:11:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we have to end apartheid, for one,
Dialogue: 0,00:11:40.28,00:11:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and slow down the nuclear arms race,
Dialogue: 0,00:11:42.87,00:11:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,stop terrorism, and world hunger.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:45.87,00:11:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to provide food and shelter \Nfor the homeless,
Dialogue: 0,00:11:50.00,00:11:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and oppose racial discrimination
Dialogue: 0,00:11:51.92,00:11:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and promote civil rights,
Dialogue: 0,00:11:53.84,00:11:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,while also promoting \Nequal rights for women.
Dialogue: 0,00:11:56.92,00:11:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to encourage a return
Dialogue: 0,00:11:59.72,00:12:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to traditional moral values.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:03.30,00:12:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Most importantly,
Dialogue: 0,00:12:04.56,00:12:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to promote general social concern
Dialogue: 0,00:12:08.85,00:12:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and less materialism in young people.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:13.19,00:12:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick...
Dialogue: 0,00:12:15.61,00:12:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,how thoughtful of you.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:53.69,00:12:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,00:12:56.78,00:12:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:16.84,00:13:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bleach-ee? \NAre you trying to say "bleaching"?
Dialogue: 0,00:13:18.92,00:13:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bleach-ee. Oh, my God. Two things.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:21.72,00:13:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,One, you can't bleach a Cerruti. \NOut of the question.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:24.01,00:13:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, I can only get \Nthese sheets in Santa Fe.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:26.47,00:13:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,These are very expensive sheets \Nand I really need them clean.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:28.72,00:13:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't shut your fucking mouth,
Dialogue: 0,00:13:31.39,00:13:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I Will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:33.65,00:13:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a lunch meeting at Hubert's \Nin 20 minutes with Ronald Harrison,
Dialogue: 0,00:13:36.23,00:13:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and I need those sheets clean \Nby this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:38.27,00:13:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I cannot understand you!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:40.49,00:13:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy. You're a fool.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:42.03,00:13:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't cope with this. Stupid bitch-ee!
Dialogue: 0,00:13:44.07,00:13:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,00:13:46.20,00:13:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,00:13:47.95,00:13:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Patrick. I thought that was you.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:50.62,00:13:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, missus.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:52.12,00:13:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it ridiculous coming \Nall the way up here?
Dialogue: 0,00:13:54.50,00:13:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,But they really are the best.
Dialogue: 0,00:13:55.79,00:13:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why can't they get these stains out?
Dialogue: 0,00:13:57.96,00:14:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, can you talk to \Nthese people or something?
Dialogue: 0,00:14:00.17,00:14:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:01.42,00:14:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are those?
Dialogue: 0,00:14:03.55,00:14:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's cranberry juice. Cranapple.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:06.14,00:14:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,00:14:07.64,00:14:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, if you could talk to them,
Dialogue: 0,00:14:09.43,00:14:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I would really appreciate it. \NI'm really late.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:11.39,00:14:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a lunch appointment \Nat Hubert's in 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:13.64,00:14:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hubert's? That moved uptown, right?
Dialogue: 0,00:14:15.23,00:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, oh, boy, listen, I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:17.40,00:14:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Victoria.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:18.36,00:14:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we could do lunch one day next week?
Dialogue: 0,00:14:20.44,00:14:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Victoria. \NI'm at work all the time.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:22.36,00:14:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What about a Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,00:14:25.20,00:14:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Next Saturday? \N- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:26.66,00:14:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't, I'm afraid. \NI have a matinee of <i>Les</i> Mis.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:28.74,00:14:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I really got to go...
Dialogue: 0,00:14:29.91,00:14:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll-- Christ. I'll call you.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:31.54,00:14:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Do.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:33.87,00:14:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you're dating Luis. \NHe's in Arizona.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:36.25,00:14:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fucking me, \Nand we haven't made plans.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:38.25,00:14:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What could you possibly be up to tonight?
Dialogue: 0,00:14:39.92,00:14:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,00:14:41.46,00:14:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>On a lot of lithium?</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:14:42.92,00:14:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Waiting for Luis to call me.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:44.63,00:14:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he'd call tonight.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:46.51,00:14:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumpkin...
Dialogue: 0,00:14:48.22,00:14:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumpkin, you're dating an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:51.14,00:14:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Pumpkin, you're dating \Nthe biggest dickweed in New York.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:14:54.35,00:14:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pumpkin, you're dating a tumbling, \Ntumbling dickweed.
Dialogue: 0,00:14:57.98,00:15:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Patrick, stop calling me pumpkin, okay?</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:15:01.57,00:15:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:03.44,00:15:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Courtney!</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:15:05.11,00:15:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dinner. \N- I can't!
Dialogue: 0,00:15:07.03,00:15:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I'm thinking Dorsia.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:15:11.24,00:15:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorsia's nice.
Dialogue: 0,00:15:12.74,00:15:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Wear something fabulous.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:15:27.97,00:15:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Dorsia.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:15:29.01,00:15:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know it's a little late,
Dialogue: 0,00:15:31.22,00:15:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but is it possible \Nto reserve a table for two
Dialogue: 0,00:15:33.60,00:15:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,at 8:00 or 8:30, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,00:15:53.16,00:15:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A facial at Elizabeth Arden, \Nwhich was really relaxing,
Dialogue: 0,00:15:58.08,00:16:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and then to the Pottery Barn,
Dialogue: 0,00:16:00.67,00:16:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,where I got this little \Nsilver muffin dish.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:05.67,00:16:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Donald Trump's car?
Dialogue: 0,00:16:06.76,00:16:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,God, Patrick, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:08.84,00:16:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Courtney, \Nyou should take some more lithium
Dialogue: 0,00:16:10.80,00:16:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,or have a Diet Coke. Some caffeine \Nmight get you out of this slump.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:14.64,00:16:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,L just want a child.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:17.77,00:16:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just two...
Dialogue: 0,00:16:19.81,00:16:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,perfect...
Dialogue: 0,00:16:22.56,00:16:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,children.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:28.86,00:16:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we here?
Dialogue: 0,00:16:30.61,00:16:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:39.25,00:16:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Dorsia?
Dialogue: 0,00:16:41.37,00:16:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, dear.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:42.88,00:16:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Courtney, you're gonna have \Nthe peanut butter soup
Dialogue: 0,00:16:45.67,00:16:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,with smoked duck and mashed squash.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:48.30,00:16:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,New York Matinee called it \N"A playful, but mysterious little dish."
Dialogue: 0,00:16:52.14,00:16:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:53.59,00:16:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And then the red snapper \Nwith violets and pine nuts.
Dialogue: 0,00:16:56.64,00:16:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that'll follow nicely.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:00.85,00:17:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:08.61,00:17:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick, thanks so much \Nfor looking after Courtney.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:11.57,00:17:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorsia, how impressive.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:14.12,00:17:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How on earth did you get \Na reservation there?
Dialogue: 0,00:17:16.20,00:17:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:19.12,00:17:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a wonderful suit.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:20.75,00:17:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me, don't tell me, \Nlet me guess.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:24.50,00:17:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Valentino couture.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:28.46,00:17:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so soft.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:30.01,00:17:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your compliment was sufficient, Luis.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:33.51,00:17:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Halberstram. Nice tie.
Dialogue: 0,00:17:36.97,00:17:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell are ya?
Dialogue: 0,00:17:38.51,00:17:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Allen has mistaken me for this \Ndickhead Marcus Halberstram.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:17:41.93,00:17:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>It seems logical because Marcus \Nalso works at P&P, and in fact,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:17:44.85,00:17:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>does the same exact thing I do.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:17:46.77,00:17:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>He also has a penchant for Valentino suits</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:17:49.36,00:17:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and Oliver Peoples glasses.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:17:51.15,00:17:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Marcus and I even go to the same barber,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:17:53.03,00:17:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>although I have a slightly better haircut.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:17:55.11,00:17:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So how's the ransom account going, Marcus?
Dialogue: 0,00:17:57.08,00:17:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-It's all right. \N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,00:17:58.87,00:18:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's interesting. It's not,
Dialogue: 0,00:18:00.54,00:18:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-it's not great. \N- Well, you know.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:02.50,00:18:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So how's Cecilia? She's a great girl.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:05.04,00:18:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm very lucky.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:07.34,00:18:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Allen!
Dialogue: 0,00:18:08.42,00:18:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on the Fisher account.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:10.34,00:18:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:11.51,00:18:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Paul. Squash?
Dialogue: 0,00:18:17.43,00:18:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:20.18,00:18:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- How about Friday? \N- No can do.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:22.56,00:18:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an 8:30 res at Dorsia.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:25.14,00:18:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Great sea urchin ceviche.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:28.90,00:18:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorsia on a Friday night? \NHow'd he swing that?
Dialogue: 0,00:18:31.65,00:18:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's lying.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:35.99,00:18:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a gram?
Dialogue: 0,00:18:38.24,00:18:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,New card. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,00:18:43.20,00:18:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:45.12,00:18:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:46.33,00:18:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Picked them up from \Nthe printer's yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:48.33,00:18:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good coloring. \N- That's bone.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:50.67,00:18:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And the lettering is something \Ncalled Silian Rail.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:53.13,00:18:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very cool, Bateman, \Nbut that's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:55.55,00:18:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:57.34,00:18:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That is really nice.
Dialogue: 0,00:18:59.22,00:19:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eggshell with Romalian type.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:02.43,00:19:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,00:19:04.81,00:19:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:06.10,00:19:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus. That is really super.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:08.77,00:19:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How did a nitwit like you get so tasteful?
Dialogue: 0,00:19:11.52,00:19:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I can't believe that Bryce \Nprefers Van Patten 's card to mine.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:19:15.61,00:19:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But wait.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:17.36,00:19:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't seen nothing yet.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:20.91,00:19:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Raised lettering, pale nimbus,
Dialogue: 0,00:19:24.29,00:19:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,white.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:26.58,00:19:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:28.17,00:19:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:31.79,00:19:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see Paul Allen's card.
Dialogue: 0,00:19:47.77,00:19:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Look at that subtle off-white coloring.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:19:50.69,00:19:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>The tasteful thickness of it.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:19:52.90,00:19:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Oh, my God,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:19:54.44,00:19:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>it even has a watermark.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:20:00.70,00:20:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,ls something wrong, Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,00:20:03.66,00:20:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sweating.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:11.33,00:20:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What beautiful skin you have, Mr. Bateman.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:14.71,00:20:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So fine, so smooth.
Dialogue: 0,00:20:25.22,00:20:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I have all the characteristics \Nof a human being:</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:20:28.18,00:20:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>flesh, blood, skin, hair,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:20:31.52,00:20:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>but not a single clear \Nidentifiable emotion</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:20:35.02,00:20:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>except for greed and disgust.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:20:39.03,00:20:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Something horrible \Nis happening inside of me,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:20:41.49,00:20:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and I don't know why.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:20:44.49,00:20:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>My nightly blood lust \Nhas overflowed into my days.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:20:48.37,00:20:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I feel lethal, on the verge of frenzy.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:20:51.92,00:20:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I think my mask of sanity \Nis about to slip.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:21:07.39,00:21:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, McCoy, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:10.69,00:21:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hamilton, \Nhave a holly, jolly Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:12.81,00:21:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Allen still handling \Nthe Fisher account?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:15.40,00:21:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. Who else?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:17.23,00:21:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistletoe alert. Merry X-mas, Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:20.57,00:21:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Merry X-mas, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:22.49,00:21:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Merry Christmas. \N- You're late, honey.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:24.41,00:21:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I'm not late. \N- Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:25.91,00:21:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been here the entire time, \Nyou just didn't see me.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:28.54,00:21:29.100,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Snowball.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:30.08,00:21:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Snowball says, "Merry Christmas, Patrick."
Dialogue: 0,00:21:33.21,00:21:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:34.38,00:21:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a baby piggy-wiggy, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:36.38,00:21:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Vietnamese potbellied pig.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:38.71,00:21:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They make darling pets. Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:41.72,00:21:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:43.84,00:21:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop scowling, Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:45.34,00:21:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a Grinch.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:46.80,00:21:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What does Mr. Grinch want for Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:48.93,00:21:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't say breast implants again.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:53.81,00:21:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Allen. \N- Marcus! Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,00:21:56.81,00:21:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How you been? Workaholic, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,00:21:59.07,00:22:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you in a while.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:01.15,00:22:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hamilton!
Dialogue: 0,00:22:02.53,00:22:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to Nell's. Limo's out front.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:04.95,00:22:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We should have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:06.41,00:22:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could bring...
Dialogue: 0,00:22:08.41,00:22:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Cecilia? \N- Yes, Cecilia!
Dialogue: 0,00:22:10.66,00:22:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cecilia would adore it.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:13.29,00:22:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then let's do it, Marcus.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:15.46,00:22:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Great party. \N- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:17.84,00:22:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick, why is he calling you Marcus?
Dialogue: 0,00:22:20.71,00:22:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistletoe alert.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:30.97,00:22:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Marcus Halberstram for two at 7:00.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:35.44,00:22:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:37.19,00:22:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I came here for \Nthe cilantro crawfish gumbo,
Dialogue: 0,00:22:39.44,00:22:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,which is, after all, the only \Nexcuse one could have for being
Dialogue: 0,00:22:42.40,00:22:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,in this restaurant which is,
Dialogue: 0,00:22:43.78,00:22:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,by the way, almost completely empty.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:45.57,00:22:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,-L'm very sorry, sir. \N- J&B straight, and a Corona.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:48.66,00:22:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Would you like to hear-- \N- Double Absolut martini.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:51.58,00:22:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:52.91,00:22:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to hear the specials?
Dialogue: 0,00:22:54.41,00:22:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if you want to keep your spleen.
Dialogue: 0,00:22:59.75,00:23:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a real \Nbeehive of activity, Halberstram.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:02.55,00:23:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is hot. Very hot.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:04.80,00:23:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, the mud soup and charcoal arugula \Nare outrageous here.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:08.97,00:23:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you're late.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:10.39,00:23:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm a child of divorce. \NGive me a break.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:14.56,00:23:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I see they've omitted \Nthe pork loin with lime Jell-O.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:17.40,00:23:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We should've gone to Dorsia.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:19.19,00:23:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have gotten us a table.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:20.98,00:23:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody goes there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:24.44,00:23:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that lvana Trump?
Dialogue: 0,00:23:27.45,00:23:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Patrick--
Dialogue: 0,00:23:29.12,00:23:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Marcus...
Dialogue: 0,00:23:30.28,00:23:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,00:23:31.78,00:23:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would lvana be at Texarkana?
Dialogue: 0,00:23:35.20,00:23:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,00:23:36.25,00:23:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn't Rothschild originally \Nhandling the Fisher account?
Dialogue: 0,00:23:39.17,00:23:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you get it?
Dialogue: 0,00:23:40.38,00:23:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I could tell you that, Halberstram,
Dialogue: 0,00:23:43.92,00:23:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but then I'd have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:53.56,00:23:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I like to dissect girls.
Dialogue: 0,00:23:55.35,00:23:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know I'm utterly insane?
Dialogue: 0,00:23:59.65,00:24:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Great tan, Marcus. Really impressive.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:02.27,00:24:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where do you tan? \N- Salon.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:04.15,00:24:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a tanning bed at home. \NYou should look into it.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:07.36,00:24:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,00:24:08.57,00:24:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cecilia... how is she?
Dialogue: 0,00:24:11.07,00:24:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she tonight?
Dialogue: 0,00:24:12.24,00:24:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cecilia is...
Dialogue: 0,00:24:13.66,00:24:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know Cecilia.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:14.95,00:24:16.100,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she's having dinner with
Dialogue: 0,00:24:17.29,00:24:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Evelyn Williams.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:18.58,00:24:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Evelyn.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:20.29,00:24:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Great ass.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:21.38,00:24:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Goes out with that loser Patrick Bateman. \NWhat a dork.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:26.05,00:24:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Another martini, Paul?
Dialogue: 0,00:24:33.72,00:24:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You like Huey Lewis and the News?
Dialogue: 0,00:24:35.56,00:24:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:39.64,00:24:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Their early work was \Na little too new wave for my taste.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:43.86,00:24:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But when <i>Sports</i> came out in '83,
Dialogue: 0,00:24:46.53,00:24:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they really came into their own,
Dialogue: 0,00:24:48.44,00:24:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,commercially and artistically.
Dialogue: 0,00:24:52.95,00:24:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole album has a clear, crisp sound,
Dialogue: 0,00:24:55.62,00:24:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and a new sheen of \Nconsummate professionalism
Dialogue: 0,00:24:58.37,00:25:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,that really gives the songs a big boost.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:10.97,00:25:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's been compared to Elvis Costello,
Dialogue: 0,00:25:13.43,00:25:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but I think Huey has a far more bitter,
Dialogue: 0,00:25:15.30,00:25:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,cynical sense of humor.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:18.22,00:25:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Halberstram. \N- Yes, Allen?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:20.23,00:25:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are there copies of \Nthe Style section all over the place?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:22.94,00:25:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you... Do you have a dog?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:25.11,00:25:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A little chow or something?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:28.11,00:25:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Allen.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:29.53,00:25:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a raincoat?
Dialogue: 0,00:25:30.86,00:25:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:33.66,00:25:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In '87, Huey released this,
Dialogue: 0,00:25:36.12,00:25:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Forel,</i> their most accomplished album.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:38.04,00:25:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I think their undisputed masterpiece \Nis "Hip To Be Square."
Dialogue: 0,00:25:41.50,00:25:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The song's so catchy.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:42.83,00:25:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Most people probably \Ndon't listen to the lyrics.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:45.00,00:25:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But they should,
Dialogue: 0,00:25:46.17,00:25:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,because it's not just about \Nthe pleasures of conformity
Dialogue: 0,00:25:48.63,00:25:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and the importance of trends.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:50.13,00:25:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's also a personal statement \Nabout the band itself.
Dialogue: 0,00:25:53.72,00:25:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Paul!
Dialogue: 0,00:26:00.43,00:26:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Try getting a reservation at Dorsia now,
Dialogue: 0,00:26:02.94,00:26:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,you fucking stupid bastard!
Dialogue: 0,00:27:01.99,00:27:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He was completely naked \Nand he was standing
Dialogue: 0,00:27:04.87,00:27:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,on the table, with no clothes on--
Dialogue: 0,00:27:09.04,00:27:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick? Patrick!
Dialogue: 0,00:27:11.92,00:27:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,00:27:13.30,00:27:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Luis, it's not me. You're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:16.59,00:27:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my very good friend, \NPatrick Bateman.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:19.05,00:27:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,00:27:20.55,00:27:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to Nell's.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:21.72,00:27:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gwendolyn's father is buying it.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:27.31,00:27:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that overnight bag?
Dialogue: 0,00:27:31.36,00:27:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean Paul Gaultier.
Dialogue: 0,00:27:45.33,00:27:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>When I get to Paul Allen's place, \NI use the keys I took from his pocket</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:27:49.00,00:27:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>before disposing of the body.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:27:51.29,00:27:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>There is a moment of sheer panic</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:27:54.34,00:27:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>when I realize that Paul's apartment \Noverlooks the park</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:27:58.76,00:28:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and it's obviously \Nmore expensive than mine.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:28:04.64,00:28:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I calm myself and move into the bedroom,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:28:07.48,00:28:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>where I find his suitcase \Nand start to pack.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:28:11.40,00:28:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>It's time for Paul to take a little trip.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:28:16.44,00:28:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to send the bastard?
Dialogue: 0,00:28:18.74,00:28:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dallas?
Dialogue: 0,00:28:20.32,00:28:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Paris? Singapore?
Dialogue: 0,00:28:23.37,00:28:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,London. I'll send the ass to London.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:33.84,00:28:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Paul.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:35.09,00:28:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been called away \Nto London for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:37.05,00:28:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Meredith, I'll call you when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,00:28:39.13,00:28:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hasta la vista, baby.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:06.08,00:29:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:08.25,00:29:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:09.91,00:29:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Jean?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:11.87,00:29:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a Mr. Donald Kimball \Nhere to see you.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:14.04,00:29:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,00:29:15.25,00:29:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective Donald Kimball.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:21.55,00:29:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him I'm at lunch.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:24.09,00:29:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick, it's only 10:30. \NI think he knows you're here.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:28.22,00:29:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Send him in, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:36.52,00:29:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, John, you've gotta wear clothes \Nin proportion to your physique.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:40.65,00:29:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There are definite dos and don'ts, \Ngood buddy,
Dialogue: 0,00:29:42.74,00:29:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,of wearing a bold-striped shirt.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:44.28,00:29:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A bold-striped shirt \Ncalls for solid-colored
Dialogue: 0,00:29:47.16,00:29:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,or discreetly patterned suits and ties.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:49.58,00:29:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, always tip the stylist 15%.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:53.58,00:29:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, John, I've got to go. \NT. Boone Pickens just walked in.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:56.96,00:29:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just joking.
Dialogue: 0,00:29:58.59,00:30:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't tip the owner of the salon.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:01.67,00:30:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, John? Right.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:03.55,00:30:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:05.93,00:30:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:07.01,00:30:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry. \NI should've made an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:09.68,00:30:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that anything important?
Dialogue: 0,00:30:11.60,00:30:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That? Just mulling over business problems,
Dialogue: 0,00:30:14.48,00:30:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,examining opportunities, \Nexchanging rumors,
Dialogue: 0,00:30:18.23,00:30:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,spreading gossip-
Dialogue: 0,00:30:20.78,00:30:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi. I'm Donald Kimball.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:23.82,00:30:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Pat Bateman. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:26.20,00:30:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to barge in on you like this.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:27.87,00:30:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how busy you guys can get.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:32.45,00:30:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's the...
Dialogue: 0,00:30:35.79,00:30:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,topic of discussion?
Dialogue: 0,00:30:37.17,00:30:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been hired by Meredith Powell
Dialogue: 0,00:30:39.92,00:30:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to investigate the disappearance \Nof Paul Allen.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:44.17,00:30:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:45.76,00:30:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Paul's disappearance, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:47.05,00:30:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's nothing that official.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:48.80,00:30:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have some basic questions \Nabout Paul Allen,
Dialogue: 0,00:30:50.72,00:30:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-about yourself-- \N- Coffee?
Dialogue: 0,00:30:52.14,00:30:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:53.39,00:30:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Apollinaris? \N- No, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:30:57.52,00:30:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you bring Mr...
Dialogue: 0,00:30:58.98,00:31:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kimball. \N- Mr. Kimball a bottle of Apollin--
Dialogue: 0,00:31:01.15,00:31:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, really, I'm okay. \N-lt's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:06.20,00:31:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's the topic of discussion?
Dialogue: 0,00:31:08.16,00:31:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The disappearance of Paul Allen.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:11.24,00:31:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:12.70,00:31:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I haven't--
Dialogue: 0,00:31:16.37,00:31:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard anything about \Nthe disappearance or anything,
Dialogue: 0,00:31:19.96,00:31:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,not on Page Six, at least.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:22.55,00:31:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think his family wants this kept quiet.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:24.46,00:31:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Understandable. Lime?
Dialogue: 0,00:31:25.92,00:31:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, really, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:28.05,00:31:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure? I can always get you a lime.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:29.64,00:31:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just some preliminary questions \Nthat I need for my own files, okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:31:33.14,00:31:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot
Dialogue: 0,00:31:34.93,00:31:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- How old are you? \N- Twenty-seven.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:38.02,00:31:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go to school?
Dialogue: 0,00:31:39.40,00:31:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Harvard, then Harvard Business School.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:41.32,00:31:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your address?
Dialogue: 0,00:31:42.40,00:31:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The American Gardens building, \NWest 81st Street.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:45.19,00:31:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice. Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:46.95,00:31:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:48.32,00:31:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you tell me about Paul Allen?
Dialogue: 0,00:31:50.57,00:31:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:52.08,00:31:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He was part of that whole Yale thing.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:54.20,00:31:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-"Yale thing"? \N- Yeah, Yale thing.
Dialogue: 0,00:31:56.29,00:31:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "Yale thing"?
Dialogue: 0,00:31:57.04,00:32:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I think for one that \Nhe was probably a closet homosexual
Dialogue: 0,00:32:02.00,00:32:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,who did a lot of cocaine.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:04.25,00:32:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That "Yale thing."
Dialogue: 0,00:32:06.59,00:32:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of man was he?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:08.09,00:32:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides the information \Nyou've just given me.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:10.43,00:32:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm not being cross-examined here.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:12.26,00:32:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel like that?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:14.06,00:32:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:17.35,00:32:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Paul hang out?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:19.35,00:32:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hang out? \N- Yeah, you know, hang out.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:21.40,00:32:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me think.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:23.19,00:32:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Newport, Harry's,
Dialogue: 0,00:32:25.65,00:32:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Flutie's, lndochine,
Dialogue: 0,00:32:28.03,00:32:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nell's, the Cornell Club,
Dialogue: 0,00:32:29.70,00:32:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the New York Yacht Club.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:31.07,00:32:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He had a yacht?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:32.16,00:32:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he just hung out there.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:33.66,00:32:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And where did he go to school?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:37.58,00:32:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know this?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:38.75,00:32:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to know if you know.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:44.88,00:32:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Before Yale, if I remember correctly, \NSaint Paul's.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:47.92,00:32:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I just...
Dialogue: 0,00:32:49.93,00:32:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to help.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:52.93,00:32:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,00:32:57.02,00:32:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any witnesses or fingerprints?
Dialogue: 0,00:32:58.52,00:33:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's a message \Non his answering machine
Dialogue: 0,00:33:01.52,00:33:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,that says he went to London.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:02.73,00:33:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he did, huh?
Dialogue: 0,00:33:03.86,00:33:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- His girlfriend doesn't think so. \N- But has anyone seen him in London?
Dialogue: 0,00:33:06.61,00:33:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, yes,
Dialogue: 0,00:33:08.53,00:33:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've had a hard time getting \Nactual verification.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:10.90,00:33:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A Stephen Hughes said \Nhe saw him at a restaurant there.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:14.66,00:33:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I checked it out, and what happened is
Dialogue: 0,00:33:16.28,00:33:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,he mistook a Herbert Ainsworth for Paul, \Nso...
Dialogue: 0,00:33:19.16,00:33:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Had his apartment been burglarized?
Dialogue: 0,00:33:20.71,00:33:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, actually, it hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:23.00,00:33:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Toiletries were missing, a suit was gone, \Nso was some luggage. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:26.17,00:33:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, no one's dealing with \Nthe homicide squad yet or anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,00:33:28.67,00:33:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not yet. As I said, we're not sure.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:31.09,00:33:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Basically, \Nno one's seen or heard anything.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:34.01,00:33:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So typical, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,00:33:35.39,00:33:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just strange.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:36.93,00:33:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,One day someone's walking around,
Dialogue: 0,00:33:38.93,00:33:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,going to work, alive, and then--
Dialogue: 0,00:33:41.73,00:33:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:44.19,00:33:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,People just disappear.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:46.23,00:33:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Earth just opens up and swallows them.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:51.11,00:33:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eerie.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:52.57,00:33:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Really eerie.
Dialogue: 0,00:33:59.87,00:34:01.100,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you'll have to excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:02.08,00:34:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a lunch meeting with Cliff Huxtable \Nat the Four Seasons in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:06.54,00:34:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Four Seasons?
Dialogue: 0,00:34:08.38,00:34:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a little far uptown?
Dialogue: 0,00:34:10.09,00:34:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, aren't you going to be late?
Dialogue: 0,00:34:12.47,00:34:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there's one down here.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:14.13,00:34:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really? I didn't know that. \N- Yes. It's very good.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:16.55,00:34:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,00:34:17.80,00:34:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,if anything else occurs to you, \Nany information--
Dialogue: 0,00:34:20.56,00:34:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely. I'm 100% with you.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:22.39,00:34:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, and...
Dialogue: 0,00:34:24.73,00:34:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks for your time, Mr. Bateman.
Dialogue: 0,00:34:30.94,00:34:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye-bye. \N- Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:11.86,00:35:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you around here.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:13.61,00:35:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You just haven't been looking.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:15.07,00:35:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to see my apartment?
Dialogue: 0,00:35:18.03,00:35:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:21.62,00:35:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come to \Nmy apartment or not?
Dialogue: 0,00:35:25.50,00:35:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not supposed to, \Nbut I can make an exception.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:32.46,00:35:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you take a credit card?
Dialogue: 0,00:35:34.92,00:35:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,L'm joking.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:36.09,00:35:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get in.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:48.65,00:35:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like a girl, early 20s, blonde,
Dialogue: 0,00:35:51.94,00:35:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,who does couples. Couples.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:54.23,00:35:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And I really can't stress blonde enough.
Dialogue: 0,00:35:57.36,00:35:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Blonde.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:01.74,00:36:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Paul.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:03.33,00:36:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Paul Allen.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:05.12,00:36:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,00:36:07.25,00:36:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Christie.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:08.71,00:36:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're to respond only to Christie.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:11.13,00:36:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 0,00:36:12.75,00:36:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If they have a good personality \Nand they're not great-looking,
Dialogue: 0,00:36:15.30,00:36:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,then who fuckin' cares?
Dialogue: 0,00:36:16.59,00:36:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say, hypothetically, okay, \Nwhat if they have a good personality?
Dialogue: 0,00:36:22.43,00:36:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know...
Dialogue: 0,00:36:23.81,00:36:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no girls \Nwith good personalities.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:26.64,00:36:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A good personality consists of \Na chick with a little hard body
Dialogue: 0,00:36:29.35,00:36:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,who'll satisfy all sexual demands \Nwithout being too slutty about things,
Dialogue: 0,00:36:33.19,00:36:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and will essentially keep \Nher dumb fucking mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:35.32,00:36:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The only girls with good personalities
Dialogue: 0,00:36:37.28,00:36:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,who are smart, or maybe funny,
Dialogue: 0,00:36:38.82,00:36:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,or halfway intelligent or talented,
Dialogue: 0,00:36:40.66,00:36:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,though God knows what the fuck that means,
Dialogue: 0,00:36:42.99,00:36:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-are ugly chicks. \N- Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:44.62,00:36:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is because they have to make up \Nfor how fucking unattractive they are.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:47.83,00:36:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what Ed Gein said about women?
Dialogue: 0,00:36:49.41,00:36:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ed Gein? MaTtre d' at Canal Bar?
Dialogue: 0,00:36:51.12,00:36:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Serial killer. Wisconsin in the '50s.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:53.96,00:36:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- And what did Ed say? \N- He said,
Dialogue: 0,00:36:55.17,00:36:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"When I see a pretty girl \Nwalking down the street,
Dialogue: 0,00:36:57.09,00:36:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I think two things.
Dialogue: 0,00:36:58.26,00:37:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One part of me wants to take her out \Nand talk to her,
Dialogue: 0,00:37:01.26,00:37:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,be real nice and sweet \Nand treat her right."
Dialogue: 0,00:37:03.76,00:37:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And what did the other part of him think?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:05.72,00:37:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What her head would look like on a stick.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:13.19,00:37:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:15.23,00:37:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get your opinion on something.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:17.65,00:37:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my business card.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:20.36,00:37:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to get a new one, too.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:25.99,00:37:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,00:37:27.33,00:37:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Very nice, Luis.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:31.12,00:37:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:46.55,00:37:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, what about dinner?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:48.06,00:37:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you ever have to contribute, \NVan Patten?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:50.02,00:37:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"What about fucking dinner?"
Dialogue: 0,00:37:51.39,00:37:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheer up there, Bateman.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:52.85,00:37:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, \Nno shiatsu this mornin'?
Dialogue: 0,00:37:54.56,00:37:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch me again like that, \Nand you'll draw back a stump.
Dialogue: 0,00:37:56.61,00:37:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hold on there, little buddy. \N- Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:36.44,00:38:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,God. Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:39.32,00:38:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why here?
Dialogue: 0,00:38:40.44,00:38:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen you looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:43.07,00:38:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've noticed...
Dialogue: 0,00:38:44.70,00:38:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,your...
Dialogue: 0,00:38:46.28,00:38:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,hot body.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:49.16,00:38:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:51.29,00:38:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't imagine how long \NI've wanted this,
Dialogue: 0,00:38:53.54,00:38:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,ever since that Christmas party \Nat Arizona 206.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:56.00,00:38:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the one.
Dialogue: 0,00:38:57.13,00:38:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You were wearing that red-striped \Npaisley Armani tie.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:02.88,00:39:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:04.92,00:39:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you, too.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:07.43,00:39:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Patrick! \N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,00:39:10.51,00:39:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,00:39:12.77,00:39:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta return some videotapes.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:22.28,00:39:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick!
Dialogue: 0,00:39:48.76,00:39:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Monday? The 20th.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:50.93,00:39:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Monday? That's...
Dialogue: 0,00:39:52.81,00:39:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Any Paul Allen? \N- Reservation... no.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:54.60,00:39:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- No reservation, but-- \N- Kimball.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:56.48,00:39:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been wanting to talk with you. \NCome into my office.
Dialogue: 0,00:39:58.73,00:40:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean, great jacket. Matsuda?
Dialogue: 0,00:40:00.98,00:40:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember where you were \Nthe night of Paul's disappearance?
Dialogue: 0,00:40:04.73,00:40:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Which was on the 20th of December?
Dialogue: 0,00:40:07.24,00:40:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:08.82,00:40:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I was probably \Nreturning videotapes.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:15.41,00:40:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a date with a girl named Veronica.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:17.41,00:40:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I've got.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:19.04,00:40:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,00:40:20.17,00:40:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the information I've received.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:23.04,00:40:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I-- Wait.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:24.75,00:40:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What information have you received?
Dialogue: 0,00:40:26.17,00:40:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:31.05,00:40:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- You were with-- \N- Well, I could be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:33.93,00:40:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When was the last time \Nyou were with Paul Allen?
Dialogue: 0,00:40:36.22,00:40:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd gone to a new musical called
Dialogue: 0,00:40:40.65,00:40:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Oh, Africa, Brave Africa.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:40:42.61,00:40:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a laugh riot.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:43.82,00:40:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That was about it.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:45.61,00:40:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we had dinner at Orso's.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:47.28,00:40:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Petal... No, Orso's.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:49.28,00:40:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope I've been informative. \NLong day. Bit scattered.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:52.37,00:40:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a little spent now, too.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:54.58,00:40:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,00:40:55.83,00:40:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,how about lunch in a week or so?
Dialogue: 0,00:40:58.12,00:40:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,When I've sorted out all this information.
Dialogue: 0,00:40:59.96,00:41:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Great. Yes, I'd like that.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:01.54,00:41:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you could try and pin down \Nwhere you were
Dialogue: 0,00:41:05.17,00:41:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,the night of Paul Allen's disappearance, \Nit would make my job a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:08.92,00:41:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely. I'm with you on that one.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:15.64,00:41:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huey Lewis And The News.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:19.48,00:41:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Great stuff.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:20.85,00:41:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I just bought it on my way here. \NYou heard it?
Dialogue: 0,00:41:23.98,00:41:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:25.52,00:41:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't really like singers.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:27.90,00:41:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a big music fan, huh?
Dialogue: 0,00:41:30.03,00:41:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I like music.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:31.49,00:41:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just, they're...
Dialogue: 0,00:41:34.49,00:41:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huey's too black-sounding for me.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:36.87,00:41:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To each his own.
Dialogue: 0,00:41:40.33,00:41:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,00:41:41.66,00:41:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunch next week?
Dialogue: 0,00:41:43.00,00:41:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:19.91,00:42:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you call me before Easter?
Dialogue: 0,00:42:22.71,00:42:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:28.34,00:42:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing tonight?
Dialogue: 0,00:42:29.88,00:42:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner at River Café.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:32.63,00:42:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Au Bar afterwards, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:34.09,00:42:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:37.51,00:42:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew you smoked.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:40.43,00:42:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You never noticed.
Dialogue: 0,00:42:45.56,00:42:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,00:42:47.02,00:42:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick...
Dialogue: 0,00:42:49.19,00:42:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,00:42:55.95,00:42:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You look
Dialogue: 0,00:42:57.82,00:42:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:00.37,00:43:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothin' to say.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:02.12,00:43:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna marry Luis.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:04.21,00:43:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that special.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:07.96,00:43:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick...
Dialogue: 0,00:43:14.22,00:43:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Courtney?
Dialogue: 0,00:43:18.64,00:43:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't see you before Easter,
Dialogue: 0,00:43:21.31,00:43:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,have a nice one, okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:43:28.35,00:43:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You, too.
Dialogue: 0,00:43:36.99,00:43:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,00:43:38.78,00:43:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,00:43:41.95,00:43:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:13.69,00:44:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this theory now that \Nif you can catch the AIDS virus
Dialogue: 0,00:44:16.65,00:44:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,through having sex with someone, \Nthen you can catch anything.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:20.20,00:44:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alzheimer's, muscular dystrophy,
Dialogue: 0,00:44:22.70,00:44:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,hemophilia, leukemia, diabetes, dyslexia.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:26.25,00:44:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, \Nbut I don't think dyslexia's a virus.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:29.50,00:44:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows? They don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:31.79,00:44:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:45.10,00:44:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, God! \N- What?
Dialogue: 0,00:44:46.68,00:44:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a fucking milligram of sweetener.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:48.98,00:44:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna get high off this, Bateman, \Nnot sprinkle it on my fucking oatmeal.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:52.23,00:44:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's definitely weak, but I have a feeling \Nif we do enough of it, we'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:55.27,00:44:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you keep it down? \NI'm trying to do drugs.
Dialogue: 0,00:44:58.61,00:44:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,FUCK you!
Dialogue: 0,00:44:59.74,00:45:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down. Do it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:02.32,00:45:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:03.49,00:45:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That is, if the fag in \Nthe next stall thinks it's okay!
Dialogue: 0,00:45:05.91,00:45:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fuck you! \N- Hey. fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,00:45:09.62,00:45:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, dude. Steroids.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:12.54,00:45:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:35.52,00:45:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Craig go?
Dialogue: 0,00:45:37.32,00:45:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Gorbachev is downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:39.61,00:45:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,McDermott went to sign a peace treaty \Nbetween the United States and Russia.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:42.41,00:45:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one behind glasnost, you know.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:45.03,00:45:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he was in \Nmergers and acquisitions.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:47.37,00:45:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not confused, are you?
Dialogue: 0,00:45:49.83,00:45:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:51.33,00:45:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorbachev is not downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:53.67,00:45:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Karen's right. Gorbachev's not downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:56.21,00:45:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's at Tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,00:45:57.34,00:45:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask me a question.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:00.05,00:46:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you do?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:02.22,00:46:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm into
Dialogue: 0,00:46:03.63,00:46:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,murders and executions, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:05.85,00:46:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:07.18,00:46:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it depends.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:08.85,00:46:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:09.77,00:46:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, most guys I know who work \Nin mergers and acquisitions
Dialogue: 0,00:46:13.60,00:46:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,really don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:17.02,00:46:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,00:46:19.69,00:46:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,where do you work out?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:24.20,00:46:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm dumb, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:26.12,00:46:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,00:46:27.20,00:46:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm dumb. \NYou think all models are dumb.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:29.49,00:46:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:31.16,00:46:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:32.41,00:46:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's okay. I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,00:46:35.50,00:46:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something sweet about you.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:04.82,00:47:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Doin' the crossword?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:10.66,00:47:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You need any help?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:23.17,00:47:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:24.92,00:47:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:26.38,00:47:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to accompany me to dinner?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:29.05,00:47:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That is,
Dialogue: 0,00:47:30.64,00:47:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:33.31,00:47:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No, I don't have any plans.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:37.19,00:47:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,00:47:41.48,00:47:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't this a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:43.28,00:47:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:44.69,00:47:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywhere you want.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:46.24,00:47:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not think about what I want.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:47.82,00:47:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How about anywhere you want?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:51.20,00:47:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, Patrick. \NI can't make this decision.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:53.54,00:47:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:55.62,00:47:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,00:47:57.50,00:47:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywhere you want.
Dialogue: 0,00:47:58.79,00:48:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say it. I can get us in anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:02.38,00:48:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What about...
Dialogue: 0,00:48:13.56,00:48:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorsia?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:20.48,00:48:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:23.15,00:48:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorsia is where Jean wants to go.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:26.36,00:48:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:27.40,00:48:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we'll go wherever you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:29.66,00:48:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Dorsia is fine.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:38.21,00:48:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Dorsia. Yes?</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:48:39.79,00:48:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, can you take two tonight \Nat, let's say, 9:00?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:42.63,00:48:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>We're totally booked.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:48:43.96,00:48:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? That's great.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:45.88,00:48:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>No, I said we are totally booked.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:48:48.09,00:48:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Two at 9:00? Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:49.55,00:48:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,See you then.
Dialogue: 0,00:48:54.56,00:48:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,00:48:56.60,00:48:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,00:48:59.06,00:49:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,dressed okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:01.52,00:49:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't give a name.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:03.15,00:49:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They know me.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:05.48,00:49:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you meet me at my place?
Dialogue: 0,00:49:07.65,00:49:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,At 7:00. For drinks.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:11.78,00:49:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And, Jean?
Dialogue: 0,00:49:13.99,00:49:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll want to change before we go out.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:24.63,00:49:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick, it's so elegant.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:26.92,00:49:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful view.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:28.84,00:49:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean“.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:31.22,00:49:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorbet?
Dialogue: 0,00:49:34.76,00:49:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Patrick. I'd love some.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:42.73,00:49:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want a bite?
Dialogue: 0,00:49:44.48,00:49:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a diet. But thank you.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:46.69,00:49:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to lose any weight.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:48.15,00:49:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,00:49:50.24,00:49:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You look great. Very fit.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:53.86,00:49:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can always be thinner,
Dialogue: 0,00:49:55.83,00:49:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,look better.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:57.16,00:49:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe we shouldn't go out to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,00:49:59.70,00:50:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to ruin your willpower.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:01.33,00:50:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:04.04,00:50:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not very good \Nat controlling it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:10.26,00:50:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So, listen...
Dialogue: 0,00:50:12.26,00:50:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you really want \Nto do with your life?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:15.59,00:50:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just briefly. Summarize. And
Dialogue: 0,00:50:17.72,00:50:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,don't tell me you enjoy \Nworking with children, okay?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:20.64,00:50:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,00:50:21.23,00:50:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to travel and
Dialogue: 0,00:50:23.73,00:50:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe go back to school, but
Dialogue: 0,00:50:26.23,00:50:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:28.07,00:50:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at a point in my life \Nwhere there seems to be
Dialogue: 0,00:50:30.90,00:50:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,so many possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:33.45,00:50:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't know. I'm just so unsure.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:39.58,00:50:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:42.46,00:50:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:44.37,00:50:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:46.21,00:50:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you seeing anyone?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:48.21,00:50:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,00:50:50.46,00:50:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:52.26,00:50:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:54.30,00:50:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,00:50:58.51,00:50:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:00.64,00:51:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel fulfilled?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:03.10,00:51:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, in your life?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:06.02,00:51:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I do.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:07.44,00:51:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,For a long time, \NI was too focused on my work.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:09.82,00:51:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But now I've really begun \Nto think about changing myself.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:13.11,00:51:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, developing and growing.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:17.16,00:51:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Growing.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:18.49,00:51:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you said that.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:24.12,00:51:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that
Dialogue: 0,00:51:25.79,00:51:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ted Bundy's first dog, a collie,
Dialogue: 0,00:51:27.63,00:51:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,was named Lassie?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:30.09,00:51:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Had you heard this?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:32.21,00:51:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's Ted Bundy?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:35.34,00:51:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:39.72,00:51:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:40.64,00:51:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Duct tape.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:41.97,00:51:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I need it for...
Dialogue: 0,00:51:44.68,00:51:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,taping something.
Dialogue: 0,00:51:50.73,00:51:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:53.36,00:51:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever wanted to
Dialogue: 0,00:51:55.44,00:51:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,make someone happy?
Dialogue: 0,00:51:56.78,00:51:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No! Put it in the carton!
Dialogue: 0,00:52:00.91,00:52:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:04.45,00:52:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:07.04,00:52:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:10.54,00:52:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Make someone happy.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:13.05,00:52:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever wanted to?
Dialogue: 0,00:52:17.88,00:52:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for...
Dialogue: 0,00:52:23.85,00:52:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you could say I just want \Nto have a meaningful relationship
Dialogue: 0,00:52:27.10,00:52:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,with someone special.
Dialogue: 0,00:52:38.90,00:52:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Patrick. Patrick.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:52:40.61,00:52:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I know you're there.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:52:42.32,00:52:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Pick up the phone, you bad boy.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:52:44.66,00:52:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>What are you up to tonight?</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:52:46.25,00:52:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>It's me. Don't try to hide.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:52:48.71,00:52:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I hope you're not out there \Nwith some little number you picked up,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:52:51.08,00:52:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>because you're mine, Mr. Bateman.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:52:52.96,00:52:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>My boy next door.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:52:55.75,00:52:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Anyway you never called me, \Nand you said you would.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:52:58.26,00:53:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>And I'll leave a message for Jean \Nabout this, too, to remind you,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:53:00.89,00:53:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>but we're having dinner \Nwith Melania and Taylor.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:53:03.14,00:53:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>You know Melania. She went to Sweet Briar.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:53:05.68,00:53:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and we're meeting at the Cornell Club,</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:53:08.02,00:53:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>so I'll call you tomorrow morning, honey.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:53:09.77,00:53:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Sorry. I know you hate that.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:53:12.44,00:53:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Bye, Patrick. Bye, Mr. Big Time CEO.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:53:15.52,00:53:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Bye-bye.</i>
Dialogue: 0,00:53:21.28,00:53:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that Evelyn?
Dialogue: 0,00:53:27.16,00:53:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still seeing her?
Dialogue: 0,00:53:33.46,00:53:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I have no right to ask that.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:41.63,00:53:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to go?
Dialogue: 0,00:53:44.14,00:53:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:48.22,00:53:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can control myself.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:53.60,00:53:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I should go.
Dialogue: 0,00:53:54.98,00:53:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I have a tendency to get involved \Nwith unavailable men.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:00.65,00:54:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,00:54:03.78,00:54:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to go?
Dialogue: 0,00:54:07.33,00:54:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I think if you stay,
Dialogue: 0,00:54:09.75,00:54:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,something bad will happen.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:14.12,00:54:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I might hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:17.04,00:54:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to get hurt, do you?
Dialogue: 0,00:54:19.26,00:54:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No, I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:23.09,00:54:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get bruised.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:27.81,00:54:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:29.68,00:54:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I should go.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:37.40,00:54:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget you have \Na lunch date tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,00:54:39.02,00:54:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,with Donald Kimball \Nat Smith and W0llensky's.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:42.24,00:54:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,00:54:44.82,00:54:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It slipped my mind completely.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:06.09,00:55:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:08.51,00:55:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The night he disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:10.14,00:55:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Any new thoughts about what you did?
Dialogue: 0,00:55:14.98,00:55:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:16.65,00:55:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a shower,
Dialogue: 0,00:55:19.48,00:55:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and some sorbet.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:20.57,00:55:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're getting \Nyour dates mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:22.69,00:55:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,00:55:24.61,00:55:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you place
Dialogue: 0,00:55:26.53,00:55:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Paul that night?
Dialogue: 0,00:55:27.82,00:55:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,According to his datebook, \Nand this was verified by his secretary,
Dialogue: 0,00:55:31.20,00:55:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,he had dinner with Marcus Halberstram.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:34.54,00:55:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- And? \N- I questioned him.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:37.08,00:55:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Marcus? \N- Yes, and he denies it.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:39.29,00:55:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, at first, he couldn't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:41.80,00:55:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- But he denied it. \N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:45.34,00:55:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, does Marcus have an alibi?
Dialogue: 0,00:55:47.30,00:55:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:49.22,00:55:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He does? You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,00:55:50.97,00:55:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I've checked it out. It's clean.
Dialogue: 0,00:55:56.94,00:55:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now...
Dialogue: 0,00:55:58.81,00:55:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,where were you?
Dialogue: 0,00:56:01.36,00:56:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was Marcus?
Dialogue: 0,00:56:02.86,00:56:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't with Paul Allen.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:04.82,00:56:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was he with?
Dialogue: 0,00:56:06.15,00:56:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He was at Atlantis
Dialogue: 0,00:56:08.70,00:56:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,with Craig McDermott,
Dialogue: 0,00:56:10.87,00:56:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Frederick Dibble,
Dialogue: 0,00:56:12.12,00:56:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry Newman, George Butner, and...
Dialogue: 0,00:56:15.37,00:56:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:20.50,00:56:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, yeah. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:23.75,00:56:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We had wanted Paul Allen to come,
Dialogue: 0,00:56:26.55,00:56:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but he had made plans,
Dialogue: 0,00:56:28.97,00:56:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and I guess I had dinner with Victoria \Nthe following night.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:33.01,00:56:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Personally, I think the guy \Nwent a little nutso.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:35.52,00:56:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Split town for a while. \NMaybe he did go to London,
Dialogue: 0,00:56:37.98,00:56:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,sightseeing, drinking, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:39.90,00:56:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm pretty sure \Nhe'll turn up sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:43.11,00:56:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, to think that one of \Nhis friends killed him
Dialogue: 0,00:56:46.28,00:56:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,for no reason whatsoever \Nwould be too ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,00:56:50.07,00:56:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,00:57:13.76,00:57:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Christie, Christie.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:15.64,00:57:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure about this.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:17.22,00:57:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to go to emergency after last time.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:19.56,00:57:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't be anything like last time.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:21.52,00:57:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- I promise. \N- I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:25.27,00:57:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come in the limo \Nand talk to me for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:28.69,00:57:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Driver's here. You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:49.30,00:57:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing like last time. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:51.68,00:57:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:53.80,00:57:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're looking great.
Dialogue: 0,00:57:55.97,00:57:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How've you been?
Dialogue: 0,00:57:57.35,00:57:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I actually might need \Na little surgery after last time.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:00.23,00:58:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,00:58:01.31,00:58:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend told me I should maybe \Neven get a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:05.19,00:58:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Lawyers are so complicated.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:08.07,00:58:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,00:58:10.40,00:58:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a check.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:01.87,00:59:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Half now, half later.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:09.09,00:59:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:10.75,00:59:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Your name's Christie.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:13.05,00:59:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're meeting a friend of mine, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:15.88,00:59:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be joining us \Nin my new apartment shortly.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:20.35,00:59:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll like her.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:22.18,00:59:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a very nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:30.40,00:59:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You look really familiar.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:32.19,00:59:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you go to Dalton?
Dialogue: 0,00:59:35.53,00:59:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I met you at \Nthe Surf Bar, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,00:59:37.66,00:59:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,With Spicey?
Dialogue: 0,00:59:38.70,00:59:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe not with Spicey, \Nbut definitely at Surf Bar.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:40.83,00:59:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Surf Bar?
Dialogue: 0,00:59:41.99,00:59:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Surf Bar sucks now. It's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:44.04,00:59:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Went to a birthday party there \Nfor Malcolm Forbes.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:46.25,00:59:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God, please.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:49.38,00:59:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nicer than your other apartment.
Dialogue: 0,00:59:54.26,00:59:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not that nice.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:00.97,01:00:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you two meet?
Dialogue: 0,01:00:02.47,01:00:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. We met at...
Dialogue: 0,01:00:05.31,01:00:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God, at the Kentucky Derby \Nin '85 or '86.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:09.23,01:00:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You were hanging out \Nwith that bimbo Allison Poole.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:11.44,01:00:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot number.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:12.73,01:00:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,01:00:13.90,01:00:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a hot number.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:14.94,01:00:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a platinum card, \Nshe'd give you a blow job.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:16.82,01:00:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, this girl worked \Nat a tanning salon.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:18.78,01:00:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Need I say more?
Dialogue: 0,01:00:19.99,01:00:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,01:00:22.24,01:00:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my
Dialogue: 0,01:00:24.66,01:00:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,cousin.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:27.75,01:00:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She's from
Dialogue: 0,01:00:29.42,01:00:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,France.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:31.21,01:00:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your phone? \NI've gotta call Harley.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:38.88,01:00:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you summer? Southampton?
Dialogue: 0,01:00:41.85,01:00:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:43.14,01:00:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. It's his machine.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:45.18,01:00:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Elizabeth, it's 3:00 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:47.10,01:00:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a goddamn drug dealer. \NThese are his peak hours.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:49.52,01:00:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't tell him you're here. \N- Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,01:00:51.73,01:00:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This tastes weird.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:53.52,01:00:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Harley, it's me. I need your services.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:55.53,01:00:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Translate that however you want.
Dialogue: 0,01:00:57.82,01:00:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at...
Dialogue: 0,01:01:01.11,01:01:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're at Paul Allen's. \N- Who?
Dialogue: 0,01:01:03.03,01:01:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Paul Allen. \N- I want the number, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:05.70,01:01:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm at Paul Norman's, \Nand I'll try you again later.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:08.12,01:01:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't see you at \NCanal Bar tomorrow night,
Dialogue: 0,01:01:09.79,01:01:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sic my hair dresser on you.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:12.08,01:01:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that guy who disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,01:01:14.09,01:01:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't he work at Pierce & Pierce? \NWas he a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,01:01:16.80,01:01:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:18.76,01:01:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any coke?
Dialogue: 0,01:01:20.51,01:01:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Or Halcion? I would take a Halcion.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:23.14,01:01:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:26.47,01:01:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I would just like to see
Dialogue: 0,01:01:28.48,01:01:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the two of you
Dialogue: 0,01:01:29.23,01:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,get it on.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:33.40,01:01:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,01:01:34.52,01:01:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally disease-free.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:38.57,01:01:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick, you're a lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:39.99,01:01:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:41.74,01:01:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you find Christie attractive?
Dialogue: 0,01:01:44.03,01:01:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not get lewd.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:45.83,01:01:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in no mood for a lewd conversation.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:48.04,01:01:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:50.25,01:01:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it'd be a turn-on.
Dialogue: 0,01:01:52.50,01:01:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he do this all the time?
Dialogue: 0,01:01:56.59,01:01:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Christie, you're not drinking your wine.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:00.88,01:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me you've never \Ngotten it on with a girl?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:03.26,01:02:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:04.89,01:02:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a lesbian.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:06.43,01:02:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you think I would be into that?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:09.18,01:02:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you went to Sarah Lawrence, \Nfor one thing.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:11.52,01:02:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are Sarah Lawrence guys, Patrick.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:14.31,01:02:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me feel weird.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:21.15,01:02:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know
Dialogue: 0,01:02:23.20,01:02:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,that Whitney Houston's debut LP,
Dialogue: 0,01:02:26.32,01:02:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>called simply Whitney Houston,</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:02:29.83,01:02:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,had four number-one singles on it?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:33.79,01:02:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know that, Christie?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:35.96,01:02:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually listen to Whitney Houston?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:39.34,01:02:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You own a Whitney Houston CD?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:43.47,01:02:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,More than one?
Dialogue: 0,01:02:46.93,01:02:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to choose a favorite \Namong so many great tracks.
Dialogue: 0,01:02:52.60,01:02:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But "The Greatest Love Of All"
Dialogue: 0,01:02:54.69,01:02:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,is one of the best, \Nmost powerful songs ever written
Dialogue: 0,01:02:59.69,01:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,about self-preservation, dignity.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:03.49,01:03:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Its universal message \Ncrosses all boundaries
Dialogue: 0,01:03:07.53,01:03:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and instills one with the hope
Dialogue: 0,01:03:11.20,01:03:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,that it's not too late \Nto better ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:15.92,01:03:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Since, Elizabeth,
Dialogue: 0,01:03:19.21,01:03:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,it's impossible, in this world we live in,
Dialogue: 0,01:03:22.76,01:03:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to empathize with others,
Dialogue: 0,01:03:25.01,01:03:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,we can always empathize with ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:28.14,01:03:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an important message.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:30.93,01:03:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Crucial, really.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:35.23,01:03:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's beautifully stated on the album.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:52.12,01:03:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a firm commitment.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:54.75,01:03:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I think, Evelyn,
Dialogue: 0,01:03:56.79,01:03:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,that we've lost touch.
Dialogue: 0,01:03:58.92,01:04:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,01:04:03.80,01:04:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My need to engage in homicidal behavior
Dialogue: 0,01:04:06.17,01:04:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,on a massive scale cannot be corrected,
Dialogue: 0,01:04:09.09,01:04:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have no other way \Nto fulfill my needs.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:13.47,01:04:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:15.31,01:04:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about what, Patrick?
Dialogue: 0,01:04:16.48,01:04:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Evelyn.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:18.56,01:04:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:21.40,01:04:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Touchy, touchy.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:22.82,01:04:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I brought up the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:24.57,01:04:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just avoid the issue, all right?
Dialogue: 0,01:04:26.82,01:04:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, are we having coffee?
Dialogue: 0,01:04:28.41,01:04:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fucking serious. \NIt's fucking over. Us.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:31.20,01:04:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no joke.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:33.91,01:04:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we should see \Neach other anymore.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:36.41,01:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But your friends are my friends,
Dialogue: 0,01:04:38.79,01:04:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and my friends are your friends.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:41.33,01:04:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't think it would work.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:43.46,01:04:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a little something--
Dialogue: 0,01:04:44.67,01:04:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that your friends are my friends,
Dialogue: 0,01:04:47.51,01:04:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've thought about that.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:50.55,01:04:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have them.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:53.14,01:04:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really serious, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,01:04:55.02,01:04:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,01:04:59.85,01:05:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the past?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:02.02,01:05:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Our past? \N- We never really shared one.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:04.86,01:05:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're inhuman. \N- No, I'm in touch with humanity.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:09.49,01:05:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Evelyn, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:11.28,01:05:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,L just...
Dialogue: 0,01:05:14.49,01:05:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not terribly important to me.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:16.62,01:05:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:18.54,01:05:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:21.58,01:05:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know my behavior can be \Nerratic sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:27.01,01:05:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:29.01,01:05:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it that you want?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:30.26,01:05:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really want to do something for me, \Nthen stop making this scene right now.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:33.68,01:05:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, God, I can't believe this. \N-l'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:36.93,01:05:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I've assessed the situation, \Nand I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:39.85,01:05:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:41.02,01:05:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,01:05:42.90,01:05:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But where?
Dialogue: 0,01:05:45.48,01:05:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to return some videotapes.
Dialogue: 0,01:06:51.46,01:06:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop the weapon! Drop it now!
Dialogue: 0,01:06:53.88,01:06:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on the ground! Put--
Dialogue: 0,01:07:39.01,01:07:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning the midnight oil, Mr. Smith?
Dialogue: 0,01:07:41.22,01:07:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, now don't forget to sign in.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:13.23,01:09:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Harold, it's Bateman, Patrick Bateman.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:16.90,01:09:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my lawyer, \Nso I think you should know
Dialogue: 0,01:09:18.49,01:09:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've killed a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:19.78,01:09:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Some escort girls in the apartment uptown,
Dialogue: 0,01:09:23.83,01:09:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,some homeless people, maybe five or ten,
Dialogue: 0,01:09:26.33,01:09:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,an NYU girl I met in Central Park.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:28.20,01:09:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I left her in a parking lot \Nbehind some doughnut shop.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:30.46,01:09:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I killed Bethany, \Nmy old girlfriend, with a nail gun,
Dialogue: 0,01:09:33.08,01:09:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and some man,
Dialogue: 0,01:09:35.59,01:09:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,some faggot with a dog.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:38.26,01:09:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Last week, I killed another girl
Dialogue: 0,01:09:42.26,01:09:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,with a chain saw.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:46.64,01:09:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:47.85,01:09:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She almost got away,
Dialogue: 0,01:09:49.77,01:09:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 0,01:09:51.69,01:09:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone else there. I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:54.19,01:09:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a model.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:55.98,01:09:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She's dead, too,
Dialogue: 0,01:09:57.61,01:09:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and Paul Allen.
Dialogue: 0,01:09:59.99,01:10:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I killed Paul Allen \Nwith an ax in the face.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:03.70,01:10:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His body is dissolving \Nin a bathtub in Hell's Kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:08.29,01:10:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to leave anything out here.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:10.12,01:10:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I've killed maybe 20 people,
Dialogue: 0,01:10:12.92,01:10:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe 40.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:16.67,01:10:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have tapes of a lot of it.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:19.76,01:10:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of the girls have seen the tapes.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:22.22,01:10:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I even...
Dialogue: 0,01:10:31.89,01:10:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I ate some of their brains...
Dialogue: 0,01:10:35.90,01:10:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and I tried to cook a little.
Dialogue: 0,01:10:40.78,01:10:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight I...
Dialogue: 0,01:10:43.82,01:10:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had to kill a lot of people,
Dialogue: 0,01:10:48.08,01:10:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 0,01:10:53.33,01:10:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure
Dialogue: 0,01:10:55.50,01:10:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get away with it this time.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:01.34,01:11:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I mean...
Dialogue: 0,01:11:06.09,01:11:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,01:11:08.05,01:11:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a pretty...
Dialogue: 0,01:11:11.52,01:11:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess I'm a pretty sick guy.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:16.10,01:11:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,01:11:18.82,01:11:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,if you get back tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,01:11:22.07,01:11:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I may show up at Harry's Bar.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:24.24,01:11:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you know.
Dialogue: 0,01:11:27.32,01:11:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:48.97,01:13:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you my 2:00?
Dialogue: 0,01:13:51.55,01:13:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,01:13:54.43,01:13:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,01:13:56.64,01:13:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for...
Dialogue: 0,01:13:59.23,01:14:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Paul Allen's place.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:01.69,01:14:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he live here?
Dialogue: 0,01:14:03.90,01:14:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:06.11,01:14:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,01:14:08.82,01:14:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw the ad in the Times?
Dialogue: 0,01:14:10.78,01:14:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:12.32,01:14:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I mean, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:14.82,01:14:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In <i>the Times.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:14:16.16,01:14:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no ad in the Times.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:19.04,01:14:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you should go now.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:21.33,01:14:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think...
Dialogue: 0,01:14:25.59,01:14:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know what happened here.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:27.09,01:14:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make any trouble, please.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:30.42,01:14:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you 90-
Dialogue: 0,01:14:45.19,01:14:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:46.77,01:14:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,01:14:48.82,01:14:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,01:15:21.10,01:15:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick Bateman's office.
Dialogue: 0,01:15:22.35,01:15:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Jean?</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:15:23.73,01:15:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,-/ <i>need help.</i> \N- Patrick, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,01:15:27.02,01:15:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Jean, I'm not--
Dialogue: 0,01:15:29.52,01:15:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Craig McDermott called.
Dialogue: 0,01:15:30.98,01:15:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wants to meet you, David Van Patten \Nand Tim Bryce at Harry's for drinks.
Dialogue: 0,01:15:34.36,01:15:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,01:15:35.74,01:15:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say, you dumb bitch?
Dialogue: 0,01:15:38.37,01:15:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Patrick, I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,01:15:39.99,01:15:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>What am I doing?</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:15:42.29,01:15:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Patrick? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,01:15:45.83,01:15:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm gonna make it, Jean,
Dialogue: 0,01:15:50.04,01:15:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to the office this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,01:15:52.88,01:15:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,01:15:54.92,01:15:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Just say no!</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:15:58.26,01:15:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Patrick? Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,01:16:00.18,01:16:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop sounding so fucking sad!
Dialogue: 0,01:16:04.48,01:16:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Jesus!</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:17:23.01,01:17:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Table for three.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:24.56,01:17:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Bateman, you look a little wild-eyed. \NRough day at the office?
Dialogue: 0,01:17:27.85,01:17:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, Bryce is back, \Nand he's drinking mineral water.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:30.44,01:17:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a changed man except he still can't \Nget a reservation to save his life.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:34.40,01:17:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just try 150 Wooster?
Dialogue: 0,01:17:36.69,01:17:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere \Nunless we have a reservation.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:39.65,01:17:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Le Cirque, Flamingo East, Oyster Bar.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:42.62,01:17:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, faggots, let's get a res.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:44.12,01:17:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your shirt on.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:45.53,01:17:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe lose the suspenders.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:47.87,01:17:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a reservation for 8:30.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:49.62,01:17:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:51.54,01:17:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Right back.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:52.79,01:17:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,10:00 would not be any good, no.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:54.67,01:17:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just fucking call them.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:56.09,01:17:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give me the phone. I'll do it. \N- I'll call ya back.
Dialogue: 0,01:17:58.09,01:17:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Face it. The Japanese will \Nown most of this country
Dialogue: 0,01:17:59.97,01:18:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>-by the end of the '90s. \NShut up, Games.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:18:02.89,01:18:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They will not.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:06.10,01:18:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Harold,
Dialogue: 0,01:18:08.97,01:18:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,did you get my message?
Dialogue: 0,01:18:10.85,01:18:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus, yes. That was hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:12.90,01:18:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That was you, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,01:18:13.94,01:18:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:15.36,01:18:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bateman killing Allen \Nand the escort girls.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:17.23,01:18:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fabulous. That's rich.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:18.86,01:18:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,01:18:20.11,01:18:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The message you left.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:21.49,01:18:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Davis, how's Cynthia?
Dialogue: 0,01:18:23.24,01:18:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still seeing her, right?
Dialogue: 0,01:18:24.53,01:18:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Harold. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,01:18:26.45,01:18:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:28.16,01:18:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:30.25,01:18:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that Edward Towers?
Dialogue: 0,01:18:34.75,01:18:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Davis.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:37.04,01:18:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not one to badmouth anyone.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:39.51,01:18:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Your joke was amusing,
Dialogue: 0,01:18:40.59,01:18:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:42.13,01:18:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You had one fatal flaw.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:45.01,01:18:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bateman is such a dork.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:47.47,01:18:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a boring, spineless lightweight.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:50.47,01:18:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if you said Bryce or McDermott...
Dialogue: 0,01:18:53.27,01:18:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it was amusing.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:54.77,01:18:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if you'll excuse me, \NI really must be going.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:56.90,01:18:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,01:18:59.65,01:19:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:02.11,01:19:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it, Carnes.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:05.20,01:19:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:06.53,01:19:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Patrick Bateman.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:12.41,01:19:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I chopped Allen's fucking head off.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:15.83,01:19:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole message I left \Non your machine was true.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:20.84,01:19:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:22.51,01:19:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I really must be going now.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:24.59,01:19:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, listen.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:27.22,01:19:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,01:19:29.56,01:19:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not Davis.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:31.06,01:19:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Patrick Bateman.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:35.35,01:19:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We talk on the phone all the time.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:38.81,01:19:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,01:19:42.49,01:19:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:45.91,01:19:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>Now, Games...</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:19:48.41,01:19:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,listen.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:50.16,01:19:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen very, very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,01:19:56.12,01:19:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I killed Paul Allen...
Dialogue: 0,01:20:00.09,01:20:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and I liked it.
Dialogue: 0,01:20:02.51,01:20:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't make myself any clearer.
Dialogue: 0,01:20:05.59,01:20:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's simply not possible.
Dialogue: 0,01:20:08.09,01:20:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't find this funny anymore.
Dialogue: 0,01:20:09.60,01:20:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It never was supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,01:20:12.06,01:20:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why isn't it possible? \N-lt's just not.
Dialogue: 0,01:20:14.02,01:20:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not, you stupid bastard?
Dialogue: 0,01:20:17.81,01:20:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I had dinner with \NPaul Allen twice in London,
Dialogue: 0,01:20:21.86,01:20:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-just ten days ago. \N- No, you...
Dialogue: 0,01:20:27.45,01:20:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't.
Dialogue: 0,01:20:28.61,01:20:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:11.41,01:21:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>We've seen the results of that mistrust</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:21:13.87,01:21:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>in the form of lies, divisions, \Nand mistakes.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:21:17.12,01:21:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>We need to find a way to cooperate</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:21:19.58,01:21:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>while realizing foreign policy</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:21:21.75,01:21:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>can't be run by committee.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:21:24.42,01:21:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>And I believe there's now \Nthe growing sense</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:21:27.01,01:21:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>that we can accomplish \Nmore by cooperating.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:21:31.14,01:21:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>And, in the end,</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:21:32.47,01:21:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>this may be the eventual \Nblessing in disguise</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:21:35.43,01:21:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>to come out of the Iran-Contra mess.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:21:37.06,01:21:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he lie like that?
Dialogue: 0,01:21:40.85,01:21:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- How can he pull that shit? \N- What shit?
Dialogue: 0,01:21:42.81,01:21:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where do we have reservations at?
Dialogue: 0,01:21:45.32,01:21:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm not really hungry, but \NI'd like to have reservations someplace.
Dialogue: 0,01:21:48.07,01:21:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so fucking...
Dialogue: 0,01:21:51.11,01:21:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,01:21:52.49,01:21:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,cool about it?
Dialogue: 0,01:21:53.62,01:21:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Some guys are just born cool, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:01.87,01:22:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bateman.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:04.29,01:22:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you so fucking zany about?
Dialogue: 0,01:22:05.88,01:22:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a happy camper.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:09.38,01:22:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Rockin' and a-rollin'!
Dialogue: 0,01:22:12.68,01:22:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, brother! Look,
Dialogue: 0,01:22:14.09,01:22:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,he presents himself \Nas this harmless old codger, but
Dialogue: 0,01:22:18.02,01:22:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,inside...
Dialogue: 0,01:22:19.18,01:22:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But inside...
Dialogue: 0,01:22:21.98,01:22:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>But inside doesn't matter.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:22:25.11,01:22:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside? Yes? Inside?
Dialogue: 0,01:22:27.07,01:22:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe it or not, Bryce, \Nwe're actually listening to you.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:29.23,01:22:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Bateman,
Dialogue: 0,01:22:30.90,01:22:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,01:22:34.82,01:22:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:36.20,01:22:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose moronic idea was it \Nto order dry beers?
Dialogue: 0,01:22:39.70,01:22:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a scotch.
Dialogue: 0,01:22:57.35,01:22:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>There are no more barriers to cross.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:00.43,01:23:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>All I have in common \Nwith the uncontrollable and the insane,</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:04.14,01:23:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>the vicious and the evil,</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:06.19,01:23:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>all the mayhem I have caused \Nand my utter indifference toward it,</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:09.90,01:23:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I have now surpassed.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:15.24,01:23:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>My pain is constant and sharp,</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:18.03,01:23:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and I do not hope \Nfor a better world for anyone.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:21.100,01:23:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>In fact, I want my pain \Nto be inflicted on others.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:26.58,01:23:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>I want no one to escape.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:30.88,01:23:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>But even after admitting this,</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:33.26,01:23:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>there is no catharsis.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:35.51,01:23:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>My punishment continues to elude me,</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:38.35,01:23:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>and I gain no deeper knowledge of myself.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:41.64,01:23:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>No new knowledge can be \Nextracted from my telling.</i>
Dialogue: 0,01:23:45.48,01:23:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,<i>This confession has meant nothing.</i>
